## Child-facing explanation of the three current missions (FG01, FG11, FG08).
##
## Presentation only. The authored quest JSON stays the source of truth for rules,
## stages, answers and rewards; saved instances freeze that JSON, so wording that
## must reach existing saves lives here instead. Every lookup falls back to the
## authored text, which keeps imported and family-made adventures untouched.
## Voice: second person, feminine, respectful and concrete. Nobody is "waiting
## for an adult to activate" anything; real-world steps say what to do and why.

